        {
          "kind": "descriptionChanged",
          "entryId": 129597,
          "effectIndex": null,
          "rank": null,
          "old": "Transforms the Druid into Moonkin Form. While in this form, the armor contribution from items is increased by $24905s1%, Omen of Clarity gains $s5% increased chance to trigger, and all party members within $24907a1 yards have their critical strike chance increased by $24907s1%, exclusive with Leader of the Pack. The Moonkin cannot cast healing spells while shapeshifted.\r\n\r\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.",
